; SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
;
; programhost — the driver's program (phase (b)2): compiler.NewProgram over the
; System's map file system, GetDiagnosticsOfAnyProgram and Program.Emit, as
; internal/execute/tsc's EmitFilesAndReportErrors asks them.
;
; ★ The program is the one the case yardsticks build (tscaly_dump's errors path):
; every file of the map file system into the file table, the file loader over the
; root names, the program's checker over the files it holds. What differs is where
; the text comes from — the System, whose reads end a default lib's status — and
; that the per-file composition rules caseerrors.py applies to the dump's raw
; sections (getBindAndCheckDiagnosticsWithChecker, getDiagnosticsWithPrecedingDirectives)
; are the program's own here.

